00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,500
It's Zhangye Danxia, in Gansu — and the stripes are real rock.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,000
Each colour is a different mineral: rust-red hematite, yellow iron, green chlorite.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Tens of millions of years of sediment, tilted up when India hit Asia, then eroded.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,500
Honest catch: many viral photos are cranked up — but the layers are real. Double-tap if you'd go.

